Input: {"question": "What is the medium of \"Monkey Grip\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d00", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "Monkey Grip (film) Monkey Grip is a 1982 Australian drama film directed by Ken Cameron."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d00", "start": 88, "end": 157, "text": "It is based on the novel, also titled \"Monkey Grip\", by Helen Garner."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d00", "start": 158, "end": 237, "text": "It was screened in the Un Certain Regard section the 1982 Cannes Film Festival."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d00", "start": 238, "end": 322, "text": "The film was produced by Patricia Lovell and stars Noni Hazelhurst and Colin Friels."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d00", "start": 323, "end": 447, "text": "Ken Cameron tried to get up a film version of Helen Garner's novel in early 1979 but could not raise the budget of $553,000."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d00", "start": 448, "end": 545, "text": "Shooting was postponed until Patricia Lovell managed to get the money under 10BA tax regulations."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d00", "start": 546, "end": 572, "text": "However, by then costs had"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d01", "start": 0, "end": 175, "text": "References [ edit ] ^ a b c David Stratton , The Avocado Plantation : Boom and Bust in the Australian Film Industry , Pan MacMillan , 1990 p139-141 ^ Maslin , Janet ( 2007 ) ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d01", "start": 176, "end": 206, "text": "`` NY Times : Monkey Grip '' ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0167-0a2fa6420467:d01", "start": 207, "end": 225, "text": "Movies & TV Dept